WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
India just beat America.

00:01.630 --> 00:02.840
On ChatGPT.

00:03.240 --> 00:08.180
OpenAI's India head says India is now its biggest market, by weekly users.

00:08.405 --> 00:10.250
In February, it was number two.

00:10.400 --> 00:12.340
Users have doubled since January.

00:12.740 --> 00:13.960
But here's the catch.

00:14.360 --> 00:17.060
A weekly user is anyone who opened it once.

00:17.295 --> 00:17.890
Once.

00:18.270 --> 00:19.380
That's the whole bar.

00:19.680 --> 00:22.290
And it's the only usage number OpenAI shares.

00:22.730 --> 00:24.580
So is India really number one?

00:24.700 --> 00:26.060
Or just the most curious?

00:26.410 --> 00:28.730
Tell me below. Do you actually pay for it?
